# Flowise VM — .env. The real .env is gitignored and created on first boot.
#
# firstboot.sh AUTO-GENERATES the per-VM Flowise secrets into this file
# (FLOWISE_SECRETKEY_OVERWRITE, JWT_AUTH_TOKEN_SECRET, JWT_REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET,
# TOKEN_HASH_SECRET, EXPRESS_SESSION_SECRET) — you do NOT set them by hand.
#
# Nothing else is required: Flowise serves its own UI on http://<host>:3000 and
# handles its own admin account + provider config. avots is configured INSIDE
# Flowise as an OpenAI-compatible provider (pick "OpenAI"):
#   Base URL = https://api.avots.ai/openai/v1
#   API key  = your av_mcp_... key
#   Model    = e.g. anthropic/claude-opus-4.8
